{"page":60,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:78","surah":3,"ayah":78,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ مِنْهُمْ لَفَرِيقًا يَلْوُۥنَ أَلْسِنَتَهُم بِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ لِتَحْسَبُوهُ مِنَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَمَا هُوَ مِنَ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَيَقُولُونَ هُوَ مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ وَمَا هُوَ مِنْ عِندِ ٱللَّهِ وَيَقُولُونَ عَلَى ٱللَّهِ ٱلْكَذِبَ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There are some who twist the Scripture with their tongues to make you [people] think that what they say is part of the Scripture when it is not; they say it is from God when it is not; they attribute lies to God and they know it.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَفَرِيقًۭا","en_gloss":"surely (is) a group ","transliteration":"lafarīqan","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَلْوُۥنَ","en_gloss":"they distort","transliteration":"yalwūna","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَلْسِنَتَهُم","en_gloss":"their tongues","transliteration":"alsinatahum","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"in (reciting) the Book","transliteration":"bil-kitābi","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِتَحْسَبُوهُ","en_gloss":"so that you may think it","transliteration":"litaḥsabūhu","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":11,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"(is) from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitābi","verse_key":"3:78"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَيَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"And they say","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","verse_key":"3:78"}